# The real bank receipt Sam supplied on 2026-08-24 for the layout test.
#
# It carries a customer's name, both card numbers and the bank reference, and a
# repository remembers a file long after it is deleted — so it lives on disk and
# never in history. Sam's decision, 2026-08-24.
#
# Nothing depends on it: `e2e/fixtures/receipt-portrait.svg` is a drawn copy at
# the same 591×1280, and every assertion in `money-layout.spec.ts` is about size.
apps/dashboard-worker/e2e/fixtures/*.local.*
